{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号白色粗体文字，位置靠上、字号最大，首先吸引视线；随后容易被下方另一块同样醒目的白色粗体文字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定。只能初步知道这个人心里憋着一股气，具体处境和情绪变化的原因尚不清楚。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、有气。\",\n  \"missed\": \"想起从前被人当作自己人时短暂的高兴，以及高兴尚未消退就转为心酸、意识到从前的日子回不去，并怀疑离开后是否真的会更好。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样显眼的白色大字争夺主视线。\",\n    \"单块文字较长，包含处境、回忆、情绪变化和追问，需要读完整句才能理解。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块大字里，要拼接才能理解从短暂高兴到心酸的变化。\",\n    \"中间有多条分散排列的紫色文字，需要在多条之间挑选，增加扫读干扰。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7873b835-5b29-4da4-a142-eb8495da8088", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T032813289144Z", "elapsed_seconds": 20.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:28:33.548282+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b8931830938b7d1a0702621d850a1a7516af402e99ff758e0d6ae382a3c58103", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33c